            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I created a dummyplugin project on github\r\nPushed a first commit, and added a tag v1.0.0 in the terminal.\r\nWith a minimal repro, the plugin is retrieved.\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nadd({ source = \"abeldekat/dummyplugin\", checkout = \"v1.0.0\", monitor = \"main\" })\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn the project I added a second commit, and DepsUpdate works as intended.\r\nI added a third commit, and repeated the steps, with succes:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n--- dummyplugin ---\r\nPath:   /home/user/.local/share/repro/site/pack/deps/opt/dummyplugin\r\nSource: https://github.com/abeldekat/dummyplugin\r\nState:  d6f05f726f1418e25a63e4dc734d396a0596592b (v1.0.0)\r\n\r\nMonitor updates from `main`:\r\n> 6124cce | 2024-03-22 21:07:46 +0100 | abeldekat\r\n  third, goodbye\r\n```\r\n\r\nNow, I am a bit lost. Perhaps my harpoonline project does not update as expected because of the `ci` I setup, in `.github/workflows/ci.yml`.\r\n\r\nI am going to create a new dummyproject, including the ci, to confirm.\r\n\r\nThanks for your time and explanation!\r\n\r\n",
