            "body": "> Now, I am a bit lost. Perhaps my harpoonline project does not update as expected because of the `ci` I setup, in `.github/workflows/ci.yml`.\r\n> \r\n> I am going to create a new dummyproject, including the ci, to confirm.\r\n\r\nOne other source of confusion for me during development of 'mini.deps' was that `lazygit` autofetched all branches it knows about. So if I open `lazygit` in the repository before `:DepsUpdate`, the monitor log will be empty (as fetching was already done beforehand).\r\n\r\nMaybe something similar happens in this case.",
