        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I mean that in the first case, mini.deps does not **actually** checkout to \"v1.0.0\". In the second case, from scratch where two commits are present, it does checkout to \"v1.0.0\".\r\n\r\nFirst case: Inside packdir, the branch is main\r\nSecond case: Inside packdir: `HEAD detached at 1a91c7c`\r\n\r\nEDIT: \r\n\r\n> if you mean that \"Monitor updates from main\" is empty after initial clone, then it is to be expected as there is nothing to compare to yet.\r\n\r\nThat part totally works as expected. I am happy that I now understand why `main` is sometimes empty. ",
